ls\n4.8\n(55 reviews)\n\nKarnal\n\n5 Star Heritage Hotel\n\nVeg\n\n₹\n4,500\n\nper plate\n\nNon veg\n\n₹\n4,800\n\nper plate\n\n25-2000 pax\n\n175 Rooms\n\n+6 more\n\nFortune Park Orange, Sidhrawali, Gurugram - ITC's Hotel Group\n5.0\n(60 reviews)\n\nManesar, Manesar\n\n4 Star Hotel with Glasshouse\n\nVeg\n\n₹\n2,000\n\nper plate\n\nNon veg\n\n₹\n2,400\n\nper plate\n\n50-2000 pax\n\n140 Rooms\n\n+5 more\n\nHow To Find The Best Banquet Halls in Delhi NCR near me?\n\nWhen it comes to booking banquet halls in Delhi NCR, how soon is too soon? Well, if you ask us, the sooner the better. Since picking wedding venues has a significant impact on the choice of other vendors (caterers, DJs and decorators), finalizing one 4-6 months before the big day is a safe bet.\n\nWedMeGood is a wedding planning platform that helps a user to find various vendors for their wedding, right from wedding venues to wedding photographers, from wedding decorators to wedding caterers, you can find them all at one place. WedMeGood is a trusted wedding planning platform listing more than 35000 verified wedding vendors. You can find more than 550 banquet halls in Delhi with a capacity of 500-1500 pax ranging from INR 500 to 1500 price per plate. From veg to non veg, venues with inhouse bar, dj & decor to banquets allowing outside decor & caterers, at wedmegood you can find a list of wedding halls with prices of your choice in and around Delhi NCR.\n\nFinding banquet halls has never been this easy. All you need to do is visit the WMG website or Download the WMG App available on Android as well as iOS. Apply various filters including cost, ratings, locality, etc and find the banquet hall in Delhi as per your requirements and the one that fulfills all your needs. You can check their menu, their prices, ratings and reviews and shortlist your favorite venues and contact them directly to get the best quote or book a site visit.\n\nWhich localities near me in Delhi have the best banquets?\n\nLocation of the venue holds utmost importance when we need to book them for hosting the wedding ceremony. It is important that the banquet hall is centrally located and easily accessible so that your guests can reach the wedding venue without any hassles.\n\nMostly searches are for: banquet halls in South Delhi, banquet halls in Chattarpur, Banquets at GT Karnal Road, banquet halls in Noida or banquets in Ghaziabad. To book a wedding hall in any locality in Delhi, you just have to select the locality from the filter and contact the venue directly to book a site visit or check for availability.\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\nDo Banquet hall prices include decoration cost?\n\nMost wedding halls in Delhi provide inhouse decor & their pricing includes decoration cost as well. Make sure that you check with your venue what all is included in the package and what are the overhead charges.\n\nCan we customize decorations in banquets in Delhi NCR? Can we hire our own decorator?\n\nMany banquet halls provide basic decor when a booking is made. In most cases, the venue has their own inhouse panel of wedding decorator in Delhi NCR that you can choose from and customise your decor. Some will allow you to hire your own decorator. You can check on their decor policy.\n\nWhat is the catering policy in Delhi NCR banquets? Can I hire our own caterers?\n\nMany Delhi banquets have their in-house caterers who serve delicious food at various events hosted at the venue and you can ask for food tasting. Some however can allow you to bring your own wedding caterer in Delhi from outside.\n\nDoes every banquet provide inhouse DJ?\n\nNot all banquet halls in Delhi NCR provide an in-house DJ for the events. Check with your wedding venue if they provide this facility, otherwise you can easily find DJ’s for weddings in Delhi NCR on WMG.\n\nWhat capacity should I look for in banquets in Delhi NCR?\n\nBefore you start looking for a Delhi banquet hall, you will first have to finalise the guestlist for the wedding ceremony and then find and book a venue allowing that capacity accordingly.\n\nHow do Banquet halls in Delhi NCR charge?\n\nMost marriage halls in Delhi charge on a per plate basis wherein they charge depending upon the number of plates used by the guests. The cost usually includes food, decor & other facilities. Some venues would charge on a Rental basis wherein the banquet halls charge only for the space that they provide and all other services are provided by a third party.\n\nCan we get alcohol from outside?\n\nDifferent venues have different policies, some marriage halls in Delhi NCR do have licence & offer inhouse bar or some will allow their clients to bring in their own alcohol whereas others have strict no alcohol policy.\n\nAre there rooms available in Banquets?\n\nMany banquet halls provide complimentary rooms for the couple and their family to get ready and stay in till the wedding ceremony. Other than this, some wedding hotels in Delhi NCR also have rooms available so that all your outstation guests can stay at the same place.\n\nWhat are the cancellation policies?\n\nAll banquet halls have different cancellation policies - some marriage halls in Delhi NCR charge a minimal cancellation fee. Check with the venue for their cancellation policy before booking.\n\nWhat time do banquet halls close?\n\nBanquet halls in & around Delhi NCR usually are open till late in the night, they however have timings for DJ & catering. Check with your vendor regarding the timing of the venue.\n\nAre there any hotels that have banquet halls?\n\nMost wedding hotels in Delhi NCR have banquet halls within them. All you need to do is apply ",
